// sword given and its draw run out first, the press attacks. The port starts with the sword in hand.
// Drop assassination from 450 uu above a guard (attack pressed while falling, directly above). Rule (melee.md
// F5, ported, 0x00C09A50 / 0x00C09900): the player falls (Velocity.z < m_fMaxAllowedDropJumpVel 0; no minimum
// fall speed), the target is below by at most m_fMaxDropDistToTarget 350 (else TooHighToStart), and a pawn trace
// reaches it; the target is the context's own or the first pawn a pawn-box sweep along the predicted fall
// (m_fHitWindowInSeconds 4, at least m_fMinDropDownVel 100 down) meets. Evaluated every tick of the fall while the
// attack is down. No awareness gate. The expected value follows the decoded rule (UNMEASURED).
